Subject: [PATCH] Split BKD codec for the POC Lucene's luceneutil copy

POC Lucene (fork bkd-split) only: stock Lucene has no PerFieldPointsFormat. Compiled by luceneutil only in the POC checkout's private luceneutil copy.
---
 src/main/perf/ColdpathSplitPoints.java | 56 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 56 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/main/perf/ColdpathSplitPoints.java

diff --git a/src/main/perf/ColdpathSplitPoints.java b/src/main/perf/ColdpathSplitPoints.java
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..43a1fb7f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/main/perf/ColdpathSplitPoints.java
@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@
